# Hangout App API Examples
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools
# 
# All responses are wrapped in a consistent format:
# {
#   "success": true/false,
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "Operation completed successfully",
#   "data": { ... },
#   "timestamp": "2024-12-20T10:00:00.000Z"
# }

### Sign Up
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Sign In
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get All Hangouts
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts

### Get Hangouts with Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts?purpose=networking&place=hotel

### Create Hangout (requires JWT token)
POST http://localhost:3000/hangouts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Networking Night",
  "purpose": "Professional networking",
  "place": "Downtown Hotel",
  "time": "2024-12-25T19:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 20,
  "isPublic": true
}

### Get Hangout Details
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts/HANGOUT_ID_HERE

### Request to Join Hangout
POST http://localhost:3000/hangouts/HANGOUT_ID_HERE/join
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Toggle Blast (Upvote/Downvote) - Reddit Style
POST http://localhost:3000/hangouts/HANGOUT_ID_HERE/blast
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Handle Join Request (organizer only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/hangouts/requests/REQUEST_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### Sign In as Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hangout.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Sign In as Sponsor
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sponsor@hangout.com",
  "password": "sponsor123"
}

### Get All Users (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Verify User (admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID_HERE",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Get My Hangouts (shows hangouts I created)
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts/my-hangouts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Hangouts by Specific User (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts/by-user/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Hangout Statistics (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3000/hangouts/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE